        ID:
          m_Value0: 6259719859501108992
          m_Value1: 7812835138104436829
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'Selects a random node from those

          linked beneath. For most
          enemies

          with simplistic AI, this will likely be

          the
          driving force for all of their logic.'
    - rid: 7865913068295553932
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
      data:
        Position: {x: -1238.2141, y: 532.07776}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 15071473936950536990
          m_Value1: 1368564599952463708
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'Tries all connected nodes in order from

          left to right.
          Useful if an enemy should

          only use a move if a certain condition
          is met.

          (Note: This node can be used to point to a

          "Random"
          node and a "Pass If" node,

          allowing for a specific move to be
          used if a

          codition is met, and random selection if the

          condition
          is not met.'
